title: "AI and Cognition: A Question Map"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Jahan
    given-names: Ariba
url: "https://aribajahan.github.io/ai-cognition/question-map/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aribajahan/ai-cognition"
abstract: >-
  A structured evidence review and interactive question map examining how AI use affects adult
  memory, learning, skill, judgment, attention, self-assessment, and related brain and
  physiological measures. The September 2026 release contains 110 unique source records organized
  around nine questions.
keywords:
